# This repo is edited from both Windows (over the SMB share) and Linux
# (on the server). Without this, core.autocrlf on the Windows side gives
# that working tree CRLF while Linux gets LF, and every file then looks
# modified after switching machines.
#
# Normalise to LF everywhere, in the repo and in every working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binaries untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
